ntinel-card max-w-3xl mx-auto p-5 sm:p-6"><label for="pw-input" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 mb-2">Enter a password to analyze</label><div class="relative"><input id="pw-input" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Type or paste a password…" class="w-full rounded-xl bg-[#0a0f1f] border border-white/10 px-4 py-3 pr-24 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-cyan-400/50 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-400/20 outline-none transition" value=""><div class="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center gap-1"><button class="p-2 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:bg-white/5 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400" aria-label="Show password" aria-pressed="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye w-5 h-5"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500"><span>Length: <span class="text-slate-300 font-medium">0</span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-3 h-3"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg> Never leaves your browser</span></div></div><div class="sentinel-card max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 p-10 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gauge w-12 h-12 text-slate-600 mx-auto mb-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 14 4-4"></path><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"></path></svg><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-300">Awaiting input</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 max-w-md mx-auto">Enter a password above to begin the analysis. Your password is processed entirely in your browser and is never sent anywhere.</p></div></div></section><section id="generator" class="relative py-20 scroll-mt-16 border-t border-white/5"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white">Secure Password Generator</h2><p class="mt-3 text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Cryptographically random passwords using your browser's<code class="mx-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 text-cyan-300 text-xs">crypto.getRandomValues()</code>API. Never stored, logged, or transmitted.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="sentinel-card p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="mb-5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><label for="len-slider" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">Length</label><span class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-300">20</span></div><input id="len-slider" type="range" min="4" max="64" class="w-full sentinel-slider" aria-valuenow="20" aria-valuemin="4" aria-valuemax="64" value="20"></div><fieldset class="space-y-2.5"><legend class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 mb-2">Character categories</legend><label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 transition"><input type="checkbox" class="sentinel-checkbox" checked=""><span class="text-sm text-slate-300">Uppercase (A–Z)</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 transition"><input type="checkbox" class="sentinel-checkbox" checked=""><span class="text-sm text-slate-300">Lowercase (a–z)</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 transition"><input type="checkbox" class="sentinel-checkbox" checked=""><span class="text-sm text-slate-300">Numbers (0–9)</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-3 py-2 hover:bg-white/5 transition"><input type="checkbox" class="sentinel-checkbox" checked=""><span class="text-sm text-slate-300">Symbols (!@#$)</span></label></fieldset><button class="mt-5 w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 text-white font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/25 hover:brightness-110 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#070b18]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key-round w-5 h-5"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>Generate Password</button></div><div class="sentinel-card p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col"><h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 mb-3">Generated password</h3><div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0a0f1f] border border-white/10 p-5 min-h-[64px]"><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">No password generated yet</p></div><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5"><button disabled="" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-slate-200 text-sm hover:bg-white/10 disabled:opacity-40 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw w-4 h-4"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg> Regenerate</button><button disabled="" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-cyan-400/30 bg-cyan-400/10 text-cyan-200 text-sm hover:bg-cyan-400/20 disabled:opacity-40 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy w-4 h-4"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg> Copy</button><button disabled="" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-slate-200 text-sm hover:bg-white/10 disabled:opacity-40 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash2 w-4 h-4"><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M19 6v14c0 1-1 2-2 2H7c-1 0-2-1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M8 6V4c0-1 1-2 2-2h4c1 0 2 1 2 2v2"></path><line x1="10" x2="10" y1="11" y2="17"></line><line x1="14" x2="14" y1="11" y2="17"></line></svg> Clear</button></div><p class="mt-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500 flex items-start gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-slate-600"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Store generated passwords in a reputable password manager. This tool never saves them — once you leave, they are gone.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="education" class="relative py-20 scroll-mt-16 border-t border-white/5"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white">Understanding Password Security</h2><p class="mt-3 text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Beginner-friendly explanations of the principles behind strong, resilient authentication.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ruler w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l2.6-2.6a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 3.4 0Z"></path><path d="m14.5 12.5 2-2"></path><path d="m11.5 9.5 2-2"></path><path d="m8.5 6.5 2-2"></path><path d="m17.5 15.5 2-2"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">Why password length matters</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Each extra character multiplies the guesses an attacker needs. A 16-character password is vastly harder to crack than an 8-character one, even with less variety.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-repeat w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 2 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"></path><path d="m7 22-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">What makes passwords predictable</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Sequences (abc, 123), keyboard walks (qwerty), repeated characters, and common substitutions (p@ssw0rd) are all tried first by cracking tools.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link2 w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2"></path><path d="M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2"></path><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12"></line></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">Why password reuse is risky</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">If one site is breached and you reused that password, attackers try it everywhere. Use a unique password for every account.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key-round w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">How password managers help</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">A manager creates and stores strong, unique passwords for each site. You only remember one strong master password.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-cog w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="3"></circle><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M10 15H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="m21.7 16.4-.9-.3"></path><path d="m15.2 13.9-.9-.3"></path><path d="m16.6 18.7.3-.9"></path><path d="m19.1 12.2.3-.9"></path><path d="m19.6 18.7-.4-1"></path><path d="m16.8 12.3-.4-1"></path><path d="m14.3 16.6 1-.4"></path><path d="m20.7 13.8 1-.4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">What multifactor authentication is</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">MFA requires a second proof (an app code, key, or biometric) on top of your password. It blocks most account takeovers even if a password leaks.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-fish w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.5 12c.94-3.46 4.94-6 8.5-6 3.56 0 6.06 2.54 7 6-.94 3.47-3.44 6-7 6s-7.56-2.53-8.5-6Z"></path><path d="M18 12v.5"></path><path d="M16 17.93a9.77 9.77 0 0 1 0-11.86"></path><path d="M7 10.67C7 8 5.58 5.97 2.73 5.5c-1 1.5-1 5 .23 6.5-1.24 1.5-1.24 5-.23 6.5C5.58 18.03 7 16 7 13.33"></path><path d="M10.46 7.26C10.2 5.88 9.17 4.24 8 3h5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.98 1.67l.23 1.4"></path><path d="m16.01 17.93-.23 1.4A2 2 0 0 1 13.8 21H9.5a5.96 5.96 0 0 0 1.49-3.98"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">Why phishing is dangerous</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Phishing tricks you into typing your password into a fake site. No password strength protects against a password you hand over willingly — verify addresses and use MFA.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-database-backup w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 12a9 3 0 0 0 5 2.69"></path><path d="M21 9.3V5"></path><path d="M3 5v14a9 3 0 0 0 6.47 2.88"></path><path d="M12 12v4h4"></path><path d="M13 20a5 5 0 0 0 9-3 4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5c-1.33 0-2.54.54-3.41 1.41L12 16"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">Why breached passwords shouldn't be reused</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Billions of leaked passwords are packed into cracking dictionaries. Anything that has appeared in a breach will be tried almost instantly.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">How to create memorable passphrases</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Combine four or more unrelated words with a number and symbol, e.g. 'velvet-otter-lantern-42!'. Long, unique, and far easier to remember than a random string.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">How to protect online accounts</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Use unique passwords, enable MFA, keep software updated, watch for phishing, and review breach alerts. Security is layered, not a single password.</p></article><article class="sentinel-card p-5 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5 text-cyan-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white leading-tight">What password security testing means</h3></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">It is the practice of evaluating a password's characteristics — length, patterns, predictability — to estimate how it might resist guessing, and to guide improvements.</p></article></div></div></section><section id="about" class="relative py-20 scroll-mt-16 border-t border-white/5"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="sentinel-card p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><div><h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">Privacy &amp; Security</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-400">How SENTINEL handles your data</p></div></div><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-5"><strong class="text-emerald-300">Privacy first:</strong> Password analysis happens locally in your browser. This application does not intentionally transmit or store the password you enter.</p><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye-off w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.733 5.076a10.744 10.744 0 0 1 11.205 6.575 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.747 10.747 0 0 1-1.444 2.49"></path><path d="M14.084 14.158a3 3 0 0 1-4.242-4.242"></path><path d="M17.479 17.499a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-15.417-5.151 1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 4.446-5.143"></path><path d="m2 2 20 20"></path></svg><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">Analysis runs locally in your browser.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-server w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">Passwords are never sent to a server or external API.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">Nothing is stored in localStorage, sessionStorage, or cookies.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="20" y1="19" y2="19"></line></svg><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">Passwords are never logged to the console or included in analytics.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cookie w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5"></path><path d="M8.5 8.5v.01"></path><path d="M16 15.5v.01"></path><path d="M12 12v.01"></path><path d="M11 17v.01"></path><path d="M7 14v.01"></path></svg><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">No passwords are placed in URLs or third-party scripts.</span></li></ul><div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-4"><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-amber-200/80"><strong class="text-amber-300">Important:</strong> No website can be guaranteed fully secure. Browser extensions, malware, compromised devices, or malicious modifications to this app can affect your privacy. Always run security tools on a trusted, up-to-date device.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#050810]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-10"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="sentinelShield" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="48" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#22d3ee"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#3b82f6"></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d="M24 3l16 5v11c0 10.5-6.8 19.7-16 23-9.2-3.3-16-12.5-16-23V8l16-5z" stroke="url(#sentinelShield)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="rgba(34,211,238,0.08)"></path><path d="M16.5 24l5 5 10-11" stroke="url(#sentinelShield)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-white">SENTINEL</p><p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Password Security Testing &amp; Analysis</p></div></div><nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400"><a href="https://masterful-sentinel-shield-ops.base44.app/#analyzer" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Analyzer</a><a href="https://masterful-sentinel-shield-ops.base44.app/#generator" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Generator</a><a href="https://masterful-sentinel-shield-ops.base44.app/